    {"dapp":"420 Pulse","contracts":["PulsePolicyRegistry420.sol","PulseProfileRegistry420.sol","PulseGraph420.sol","PulsePublicationRegistry420.sol","PulseInteractionRegistry420.sol","PulseTopicRegistry420.sol","PulseRouter420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Vault","contracts":["VaultAuthorization420.sol","VaultPolicyRegistry420.sol","VaultRegistry420.sol","VaultAccounting420.sol","AssetVault420.sol","VaultFactory420.sol","VaultRouter420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Treasury","contracts":["TreasuryIds420.sol","TreasuryAuthorization420.sol","TreasuryPolicyRegistry420.sol","TreasuryBudgetRegistry420.sol","TreasuryDisbursementRegistry420.sol","TreasuryRouter420.sol"],"note":"Genesis budget and public-funds control plane over 420Vault VAULT_TREASURY custody. Civic/GovernanceTimelock creates bounded budgets and schedules exact disbursements; a one-time bound disbursement controller atomically reserves/settles budget accounting; execution remains default-deny and capability-scoped to the exact disbursement, with single/epoch asset caps, replay-safe canonical IDs, time windows and nonzero Vault release commitments. 420Treasury has no independent custody path or unrestricted executive key."},
    {"dapp":"420 Grants","contracts":["GrantIds420.sol","GrantAuthorization420.sol","GrantProgramRegistry420.sol","GrantApplicationRegistry420.sol","GrantAwardRegistry420.sol","GrantMilestoneRegistry420.sol","GrantRouter420.sol"],"note":"Genesis non-custodial grants lifecycle over 420Civic, 420Treasury and 420Vault. Programs bind to approved Treasury budgets and Civic action commitments; applications are canonical and immutable; awards and milestones are capped; claims are applicant/capability scoped; milestone approval requires an exact matching scheduled Treasury disbursement and payment finality follows Treasury execution. Grants cannot custody funds, bypass Treasury controls, or claw back paid funds without a separately authorized recovery action."},
    {"dapp":"420 Launchpad","contracts":["LaunchpadIds420.sol","LaunchpadAuthorization420.sol","LaunchpadProjectRegistry420.sol","LaunchpadSaleRegistry420.sol","LaunchpadAllocationRegistry420.sol","LaunchpadRouter420.sol"],"note":"Genesis non-custodial project-launch and token-sale coordination layer. Projects bind an externally supplied sale asset and immutable issuance commitment; sales fix payment asset, receiver, soft/hard caps, per-wallet limits, token allocation, timing, eligibility policy and optional liquidity commitment. Contributions, claims and refunds are CapabilityRegistry-scoped and default-deny. Launchpad records payment, delivery and refund commitments but does not mint arbitrary tokens, custody proceeds, execute payments or gain unilateral 420Swap authority."},
    {"dapp":"420 Resource Protocol","contracts":["ResourceIds420.sol","ResourceAuthorization420.sol","ResourcePolicyRegistry420.sol","ResourceProviderRegistry420.sol","ResourceNodeRegistry420.sol","ResourceOfferRegistry420.sol","ResourceSessionRegistry420.sol","ResourceReceiptRegistry420.sol","ResourceRouter420.sol"],"products":["420Relay","420Store","420Cache","420Gateway"],"note":"shared decentralized resource-network substrate. Providers activate against staking references and publish service-specific nodes/offers; consumers open bounded native-420 sessions with replay-safe metering. Encrypted routes, stored payloads, cached content and gateway traffic remain off-chain. This replaces the previously mapped incomplete 420 VPN placeholder lifecycle; existing VPN contracts remain legacy compatibility source, while 420Relay is the canonical routing product."},
    {"dapp":"420 Market","contracts":["MarketPolicyRegistry420.sol","ListingRegistry420.sol","InventoryReservation420.sol","OrderRegistry420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Rights","contracts":["RightsIds420.sol","RightsAuthorization420.sol","RightsPolicyRegistry420.sol","RightsAssetRegistry420.sol","RightsClaimRegistry420.sol","RightsLicenseRegistry420.sol","RightsRouter420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Swap","contracts":["GenesisDEXFactory.sol","CanonicalMarketRegistry.sol","PermissionlessDEXFactory.sol","TWAPOracle.sol","PublicBatchAuction.sol","ApprovedQuoteAssetRegistry.sol","CanonicalSwapExecutor420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Pay","contracts":["PayIds420.sol","MerchantRegistry420.sol","InvoiceRegistry420.sol","PaymentRegistry420.sol","PaymentRouter420.sol","SettlementRouter420.sol","RefundManager420.sol","GasSponsor420.sol","AccountingCommitment420.sol","CanonicalSettlementAdapter420.sol","CanonicalSwapHealthAdapter420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Oracle","contracts":["OracleProviderRegistry420.sol","OracleFeedRegistry420.sol","OracleRiskPolicy420.sol","OracleRouter420.sol","TWAPOracleSourceAdapter420.sol"]},
    {"dapp":"420 Bridge","contracts":["VerifiedGateway420.sol","BridgeAssetRegistry.sol","CADCBridgeIntegration.sol","BridgeRouteRegistry.sol","BridgeRiskManager.sol","BridgeTransferRegistry.sol","GatewayRouter420.sol","BridgeAccountingRegistry.sol","CADCLayerZeroAdapter.sol","USDCCCTPAdapter.sol","ETHProofAdapter.sol","BTCLightClientAdapter.sol"]},
